#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:10
#. (itstool) path: component/name
msgid "Merkuro Mail"
msgstr "बुध मेल"

#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:11
#. (itstool) path: component/summary
msgid "Read your emails with speed and ease"
msgstr "वेगेन सहजतया च स्वस्य ईमेल-पत्राणि पठन्तु"

#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:18
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"Merkuro Mail is a free and open source email client. Merkuro Mail is part "
"of the Merkuro groupware suite and is currently in beta. For now, it only "
"allows you to read your emails."
msgstr ""
"Merkuro Mail एकः निःशुल्कः मुक्तस्रोतः च ईमेलग्राहकः अस्ति । Merkuro Mail "
"Merkuro groupware suite इत्यस्य भागः अस्ति, सम्प्रति बीटा इत्यस्मिन् अस्ति "
"। इदानीं कृते केवलं भवतः ईमेल-पत्राणि पठितुं शक्यते ।"

#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:67
#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
msgid "Mail View"
msgstr "मेल व्यू"